{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00352","headline":"宫中作 · 後王钱俶","name":"宫中作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"廊庑周遭翠幕遮，禁林深处绝喧譁。\n界开日影怜窗纸，穿破苔痕恶笋芽。\n西第晚宜供露茗，小池寒欲结冰花。\n谢公未是深沈量，犹把输赢局上夸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"後王钱俶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00352.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00352","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}